{
  "_help": [
    "SCP-294 drinks for this world. The machine checks this list first, by name or alias, ignoring capitals.",
    "name: what to type. aliases: other names. display: the cup's full name, default Cup of <name>. colour: #RRGGBB.",
    "message: shown on drinking, plain text or a translation key. refuse: true makes the machine answer OUT OF RANGE.",
    "effects: a list like {\"id\": \"minecraft:speed\", \"seconds\": 30, \"amplifier\": 0}. Actions run first, then effects.",
    "actions: a list of {\"type\": ...}: heal amount, damage amount death_message, ignite seconds, levitate seconds amplifier,",
    "teleport_random radius, clear_effects, feed food saturation, extinguish, glow seconds, explode power (never breaks blocks),",
    "vanish seconds, arsenic, sound id volume pitch, particles id count. %s in death_message is the drinker's name.",
    "Bad entries are skipped with a warning in the server log. Apply changes with /scp_unleashed scp294 reload."
  ],
